<title>POLAND: Tonsil Q1 net falls to PLN 0.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Tonsil Q1 net falls to PLN 0.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tonsil preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.39 vs	1.00</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.32 vs	0.56</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.22 vs	0.30</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Tonsil SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 17.01 vs     16.44</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  13.49 vs     12.90</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.01 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.10 vs	0.25</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.22 vs	0.11</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.29 vs	0.55</p>
<p>    investment				 1.16 vs	0.15</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
